{
  "schema_version": 1,
  "locale": "zh-CN",
  "scenario_id": "1_4_001_10_a",
  "source_raw_hash": "sha256:acd9bdebd0b67d2ca39a3ffe0b4d38a41f02323688a0578b452d159916f2f27a",
  "entries": {
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_10:1_4_001_10_a:cmd-000000:title:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:5b3c50f43da19ed6afccf1fa2c7e28698998671da671a34a5751845978fc7f75",
      "text": "照亮过去与未来的繁星",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_10:1_4_001_10_a:cmd-000000:synopsis:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:48d43579a1ff77ee7bf817f9e794246c77dc028e21f01a5cd64c03cc23f706bf",
      "text": "JIF正式演出近在眼前，315 Production的\n偶像们在紧张与兴奋之中，\n对舞蹈与服装进行最后的检查。\n距离开演仅剩片刻，\n他们各自倾诉起心中的想法。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_10:1_4_001_10_a:cmd-000047:title:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:bde9ae20a545cf305d5f25c2458465af716321b2fb89ec28902eb9a21ab4d67f",
      "text": "第10话",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_10:1_4_001_10_a:cmd-000047:title:001": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:5b3c50f43da19ed6afccf1fa2c7e28698998671da671a34a5751845978fc7f75",
      "text": "照亮过去与未来的繁星",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_10:1_4_001_10_a:cmd-000049:time_caption:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:f62a37ada9ed0695c470f944f2e6bc91f92ce483a23009359bef703305518a46",
      "text": "JIF当天",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_10:1_4_001_10_a:cmd-000063:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:cc95627e7dc1af0aaf0d5f9a3419559e566e6bea34918fb35b5d0a4c0c9f8be9",
      "text": "终于到了JIF正式演出……！\n情绪简直Mega Hyper MAX啦！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_10:1_4_001_10_a:cmd-000074:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:de3bdffa87e2a4624ff12f1d9a50db96e08f16c29cfcebdea864e2b94332a121",
      "text": "今天的线上直播，\n学校的大家也都在看呢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_10:1_4_001_10_a:cmd-000080:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:27d71cd0826ea0f3b0cab81f47bf8748dc369bdfbfec2d9c980578b5eb2a3dcd",
      "text": "何止学校，全世界都在看啊！\n我们超受关注的！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_10:1_4_001_10_a:cmd-000091:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:822b6ad51b09d2c80346b52bbbe53ba9f6586b6692f1df6f168f0d1df92720c7",
      "text": "是的。毕竟315 Production是通过“投票名额”\n临时决定参加的。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_10:1_4_001_10_a:cmd-000096:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:31d22dfe2c2458e3f71439c5333009ce73309428c7be438cc1838efb373d5f48",
      "text": "我想我们的存在在各种意义上，\n都吸引了不少瞩目呢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_10:1_4_001_10_a:cmd-000100:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:0b78e1ec98c20ecf6b0cf44e00aeaf5f2ed27ed0c37099df4b3a42726e933618",
      "text": "……而且，还是打头阵……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_10:1_4_001_10_a:cmd-000113:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:0928912ab582b7ad1535905984b4b40c8301802d2ce74377bd561f882a54e2b4",
      "text": "喂，演出还没开始吗。\n别让本大爷干等啊！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_10:1_4_001_10_a:cmd-000127:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:502afb60769a1feb3044307f9c886779f0642f96c7b6077ce70df5ccae0ea901",
      "text": "看来涟是迫不及待想快点登台了啊。\n要不要找个地方再稍微活动一下身子！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_10:1_4_001_10_a:cmd-000132:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:9ebf2fa1d926794790967e4ed6431af72f806efab0b14e1797bef7cf3df2087f",
      "text": "圆城寺，要去的话也算我一个。\n为了正式演出，我想把身子热得更开一些。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_10:1_4_001_10_a:cmd-000146:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:3f20ae6f232912d4d951754874ccf101120026fded2e322d8441f250d5d98c58",
      "text": "呜～心跳根本停不下来。等待正式演出的\n这段时间，真是让人紧张呢。卷卷你觉得呢？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_10:1_4_001_10_a:cmd-000152:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:7a9baf590f2b968d602b38d1df9c7ab03c219e4626e4312169c3ebcede9b0c4b",
      "text": "我也很紧张啊。虽然想着演出后要吃的\n蛋糕来分散注意力就是了……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_10:1_4_001_10_a:cmd-000164:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:5bca05dbe30bb727093717f6e2a77cb3f608bdfd540585ab6bdefb2f364c1245",
      "text": "（比平时更加热闹的休息室……大家的\n干劲与紧张感，都能真真切切地感受得到）",
      "status": "draft"
    }
  }
}
